    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110846" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλ-ανδρία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>love for a husband,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Halc.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
